{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/951470-2e-looking-for-feedback-about-social-maneuvering-being-used-on-players","id":951470,"title":"[2E] Looking for feedback about Social Maneuvering being used on players.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-15T20:32:12-07:00","id":951470,"title":"[2E] Looking for feedback about Social Maneuvering being used on players.","content":"I was initially going to write a topic looking for alternatives to mechanics that assume that Social Maneuvering can be used on PCs - powers or merits that boost PC Doors or regulate Impressions or what have you - and I might still do that, but while I was typing out my first draft I reread the version in the CofD rulebook itself that gives players the option between Go With the Flow and Offer an Alternative, and I am...partially assuaged, but still rather uneasy. I don't know -how- to feel about it. I admit, I'm always a stickler for how exactly player-targeting social mechanics should go, and Social Maneuvering kinda falls in this grey area.<br /> <br /> So, I want some feedback. How do you feel about the Social Maneuvering system when it's focused at players? When it's used by PCs on other PCs versus when it's an NPC doing the talking? How has it played out at your table? Have you worked with different alternatives, and if so how have they gone, and how much did you have to rewrite? I would love to hear it all, good and bad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-15T21:29:27-07:00","id":951485,"title":"","content":"I just have all successful Social Maneuvering attempts against PCs give the subject the Leveraged Condition tagged to the character that Maneuvered them. Works like a charm for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T00:55:01-07:00","id":951541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/951470-2e-looking-for-feedback-about-social-maneuvering-being-used-on-players?p=951485#post951485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just have all successful Social Maneuvering attempts against PCs give the subject the Leveraged Condition tagged to the character that Maneuvered them. Works like a charm for me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm interested in this solution, but my English is probably failing me to grasp it. Could you explain it, on some example maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T01:46:27-07:00","id":951557,"title":"","content":"I haven't had any issues with it, but my groups generally like defined social mechanics that are relatively equal across the board, because we've all had a few too many instances of dealing with players that want their RP to trump stats, and their &quot;agency&quot; to trump social consequences.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T06:10:12-07:00","id":951635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/951470-2e-looking-for-feedback-about-social-maneuvering-being-used-on-players?p=951541#post951541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm interested in this solution, but my English is probably failing me to grasp it. Could you explain it, on some example maybe?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure. Let's say Alice wants Bob to do something for her. She uses Social Maneuvering and manages to open all of Bob's Doors. Bob gains the Leveraged Condition (with Alice as the person who has Leveraged him).<br /> <br /> I like this approach because Bob can do what Alice wants now and get to resolve Leveraged right away, earning him a Beat, or he can refuse, keep the Condition, and later do something else Alice asks of him and get a Beat then. Either way Bob gets a Beat, and it's always his choice if he's willing to help Alice now or later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 08-16-2016, 08:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T09:19:58-07:00","id":951769,"title":"","content":"I like things to be quick n' easy when it comes PvP.<br /> <br /> Here's a link on what I wrote about it in a Vampire topic that could easily apply to any setting: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/939125-player-versus-player-vampire?p=940277#post940277\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...277#post940277</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1592-jack","name":"Jack","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1592_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-16T17:02:43-07:00","id":952139,"title":"","content":"Wyrd - Alicja chce czego\u015b od Boba. Mistrz gry dochodzi do wniosku, \u017ce najlepszym sposobem by to rozwi\u0105za\u0107 b\u0119dzie Manewrowanie Socjalne. Alicji udaje si\u0119 otworzy\u0107 wszystkie drzwi Boba. Mistrz Gry zamiast przekrzykiwa\u0107 si\u0119 o to co si\u0119 stanie dalej, wlepia Bobowi kondycje &quot;Leveraged&quot; (&quot;Kto\u015b ma na ciebie haka&quot;) - i tym kim\u015b &quot;kto ma haka&quot; jest Alicja. Leveraged masz w podr\u0119czniku - gdy osoba kt\u00f3ra ma na ciebie haka chce czego\u015b od Ciebie, mo\u017cesz - zanim w ruch p\u00f3jd\u0105 jakiekolwiek kostki - zgodzi\u0107 si\u0119 na zrobienie tego chce tak, jakby\u015b by\u0142 npcem kt\u00f3rego przekonano do tego rzutem na socjale. W zamian za to gracz z Leveraged \u015bci\u0105ga z siebie kondycje i dostaje beata.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T01:40:59-07:00","id":952389,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar9102_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"9102\" data-vbnamecard=\"9102\">WHW</a>, zrozumia\u0142em przyk\u0142ad po angielsku, mia\u0142em problem ze zrozumieniem podsumowania. I osobi\u015bcie t\u0142umacz\u0119 'Leveraged' jako Szanta\u017c. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar269_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"269\" data-vbnamecard=\"269\">Charlaquin</a>, thanks for example - Levereged has real sense here, will steal idea for my games. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}